## Existing API shapes

Your protected routes are mounted in [`app.js`](/home/spambuddy/cscc09/project-geoguesser/app.js:27):

| Request | Response |
|---|---|
| `POST /games/start` | `{ gameId, imageId, roundId, roundNumber }` |
| `GET /streetview/access-token` | `{ accessToken }` |
| `POST /games/:gameId/rounds/:roundId/guess` | `{ distance, guessLocation, actualLocation, newRoundData }` |
| `GET /games/:gameId/score` | `{ totalDistance }` |

`/games` and `/streetview` require authentication and an active subscription. Missing authentication returns `401`; inactive subscriptions return `403`.

Your existing proxy already covers these paths in [`proxy.conf.json`](/home/spambuddy/cscc09/project-geoguesser/frontend/src/proxy.conf.json:1), so no Express change is currently required.

