Leaflet is an imperative library, so Angular does not control the map through template bindings. Angular creates it after the element exists, listens for clicks, and removes it during destruction. `invalidateSize()` is important when a map becomes visible after being hidden or resized. [Leaflet reference](https://leafletjs.com/reference)

